      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS OUT (1) finished fifth at her most recent outing, beaten 4 metres, in a nice return to form at this track over 1800m. Has the benefit of a good draw. Finds a nice race and will take plenty of beating once more. VATICAN GREEN NZ (3) was in the money two runs ago then found the frame again last time over 2230m at this track, finishing 3 metres from the winner in third. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Good enough to put himself back in the winners' stall. FE FE ON FIRE (2) should be at her peak for this. Finished ninth over 1800m at this track at the latest appearance a week ago. Sure to give the top fancies plenty to think about. ALWAYSBEALADY (6) is the best of the rest after finishing fifth over 2230m at this track last time out.",
